title: Municipalities
new-page: true
is-pinned-card: true
choose-if: municipality_control_level != 0 and municipality_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Municipal action is not currently available.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.begin(this,"municipalities");Q.month_actions+=1;Q.municipality_timer=6; !}
card-image: img/belediye.jpg
go-to: municipalities_menu

= Municipalities and local governance

In Turkey, the territories of the republic are divided among small municipalities which are firmly connected with the central government. Still, the municipalities are an integral part of Turkish politics and are useful for reaching out to demographics we normally aren't performing well with through an example of our governance and services.

@municipalities_menu
on-display: {! if(typeof renderMunicipalControlMap==='function')renderMunicipalControlMap(); !}

{!<div class="municipal-control-map" aria-label="CHP control in the last municipal election"></div>!}

- @back_to_main: Return to main menu.
- @governance: Municipalities are responsible for many local tasks in which we can improve our performance and show to the people how a <span style="color: #E3000F;">**CHP**</span> government would look like.
- @politics: The municipalities not only allow us to offer a vision of our administration but also to perhaps improve our political standing through the usage of local resources.
- @no: We either won't or can't focus on the municipalities at this time.

@governance
choose-if: party_dissent < 15
unavailable-subtitle: The party dissent is too high! We are unable to influence our local governments to improve our efficiency.

- @waterlines: Urban municipalities often struggle with sewage management and providing clean water.
- @publictransport: Public transport is a crucial part of urban life and most cities are lacking.
- @libraries: City libraries can be built to support education and increase literature consumption.
- @halkekmek: Municipal bakeries, organized under the programme "Halk Ekmek" can produce affordable bread to combat inflation and support working families.
- @municipalities_menu: Return to municipal planning.

@waterlines
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_chp += 1; petty_bourgeoisie_chp += 1; state_employees_chp += 1; {! AnatolianCardActions.commit(Q); !}

We have improved sewage management in our municipalities.

@publictransport
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_chp += 3; state_employees_chp += 1; {! AnatolianCardActions.commit(Q); !}

We have bought additional buses and started planning the construction of trams in city centers.

@libraries
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_chp += 2; state_employees_chp += 1; petty_bourgeoisie_chp += 1; {! AnatolianCardActions.commit(Q); !}

The libraries we are building have already started attracting lots of students.

@halkekmek
subtitle: -2 resources
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; workers_chp += 5; petty_bourgeoisie_chp += 3; state_employees_chp += 2; AP_relation -= 5; {! AnatolianCardActions.commit(Q); !}

Many families are thankful to us for providing affordable bread. However, the political Right accuses us of "disrupting" the economy.

@politics
choose-if: party_dissent < 15
unavailable-subtitle: The party dissent is too high! We are unable to influence our local governments.

Our municipal offices can host community events and strengthen our alliances, but we first need a clear plan on how to spend the limited funds and volunteers available.

- @municipalities_menu: Return to municipal planning.

@no
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commit(Q); !}
subtitle: Hold off on municipal initiatives.

For now we will not expand our municipal efforts. We'll return to these proposals once the party is ready to commit resources.

@back_to_main
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.back(this); !}
go-to: main.main_easy if difficulty < 0; main if difficulty >= 0

